<p>I love this SCP, and like all DoMc SCPs I'm unable to adequately explain any of it. The short compositions are a lot of fun too. Strong +1.</p>
<p>Small nitpick: in the description, it said the melody doesn't fit into any popularly known scale. This isn't correct because it fits into the 12-tone or chromatic scale (unless there's something going on with microtonal variation that's not transcribed). It would be more accurate to say it doesn't reflect any common diatonic scale.</p>
<p>Overall, the melody isn't unusual, it's actually pretty simple and really pleasant, which adds to the mystery I think. I tried to deal music analysis, but no description fits neatly. It's simply C major with some chromatic variation. Overall, well done.</p>

